           role = "aut"))
Description: Server-side DataSHIELD package that computes local average treatment
    effect (ATE) statistics from arm-specific regression coefficients provided by
    the analyst. Implements the server-side components of the generalised difference
    estimator of Khellaf, Bellet and Josse (2025) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2404.18962>,
    enforcing DataSHIELD disclosure controls throughout.
